WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.350
Ever feel like you know the words,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.600
but they just don't come out
when you need them?

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.000
Here's the secret:
native speakers don't

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.400
build sentences word by word.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:10.600
They use chunks.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.150
Chunks are ready-made
blocks of meaning.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.950
Like “make a decision”,
“how’s it going?”

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.400
or “that makes sense”.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.450
Learn the chunk and you stop
translating in your head.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.800
You speak faster
and you sound natural.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.750
That’s what EnglishChunks.guru is for.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.250
Every day you get one useful chunk,
matched to your level.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.200
First you learn it: hear it,
see what it means,

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.300
and listen to three real examples.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.300
Then you say it.
Record yourself twice

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.000
and get a score with a friendly tip
on the sounds to fix.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.300
Next, make it yours.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:50.400
Write three sentences from your own
life and get them polished.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.400
Finally, read them aloud
and see today’s score.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.150
So what do you get?

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.220
One useful chunk,
12 focused minutes,

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.300
a streak that keeps you going,

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.000
progress you can actually see,

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.780
and a library of hundreds
of real expressions,

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.300
growing every week.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.050
Real English.
Ready when you need it.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.100
Start free today at
EnglishChunks.guru.
